asr-bench vendors data from, and ports code of, the Open ASR Leaderboard scorer:
https://github.com/huggingface/open_asr_leaderboard, directory normalizer/, at commit
2aaa07a5ea7c5b18ea53c511426d2079b35d1200 (2026-10-26).

  data/english_spelling.tsv, data/english_names.tsv, data/english_compounds.tsv,
  data/english_replacers.tsv and data/english_fillers.txt are dumped unchanged from that
  commit's normalizer/english_abbreviations.py and normalizer/normalizer.py
  (EnglishTextNormalizer), by tests/fixtures/make_golden.py.
  src/normalize.rs is a Rust port of normalizer/normalizer.py (EnglishTextNormalizer,
  EnglishNumberNormalizer, EnglishSpellingNormalizer, EnglishNameNormalizer,
  EnglishAcronymNormalizer, remove_symbols_and_diacritics).

