  (Most of that code derives from OpenAI Whisper's normalizers, MIT licence.)

src/align.rs ports LevenshteinEditDistanceCompound from kaldialign v0.12.0
(https://github.com/pzelasko/kaldialign, Apache-2.0).

tests/fixtures/oasr_golden.json holds outputs of the leaderboard scorer and kaldialign
0.12.0 themselves, produced by tests/fixtures/make_golden.py.
